{"id":"detra_s","lemma":"detrás","pos":"adv","rank":429,"glosses":["behind, at the rear","after"],"ipa":"/deˈtɾas/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-detr%C3%A1s.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estaré justo detrás de ti.","en":"I'll be right behind you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515090","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"right, just"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you","l":"tú"}]},{"text":"Él estaba justo detrás de mí.","en":"He was just behind me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453703","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"right, just"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"¿Qué es ese edificio detrás del hospital?","en":"What's that building behind the hospital?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582401","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"building"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"hospital"}]},{"text":"¿Quién está detrás de ello?","en":"Who's behind it?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it"}]},{"text":"Cierra la puerta detrás de ti.","en":"Shut the door behind you.","words":[{"g":"to close, to shut","l":"cerrar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you","l":"tú"}]}]}